{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 (from $4 million to $10 million).","value":6,"unit":"millions","calculation":"reserve_2006 (10) - reserve_2005 (4) = 6","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"result_id":"tool:1","message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million as of Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million as of Dec. 31, 2005, so the change was an increase of $6 million."}}